124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Properly designed safety footwear not only mitigates physical and environmental risks but also enhances comfort, reduces fatigue, and promotes overall worker well-being. Adhering to these standards ensures protection from falling objects, punctures, cutting hazards, electrical risks, and slips, while providing necessary foot support to minimize fatigue, and ensuring compliance with safety regulations, contributing to a safer and more efficient work environment. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
